{"offset": "0x5ae00", "text": "pdp_target_list 배치 ID — DB 타깃 전수 대상 (EAN 은 product_ean 마스터에서, 없으면 mpc 로 MPN 폴백)"}
{"offset": "0x5ae80", "text": "checkpoint 의 retailer 표기 (flix 등록명과 다를 때. 예: MediaMarkt_ES ← 'MediaMarkt')"}
{"offset": "0x5af00", "text": "blockwise_image_match.<locals>.genexpr"}
{"offset": "0x5af40", "text": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/126.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}
{"offset": "0x5afc0", "text": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8"}
{"offset": "0x5b000", "text": "--single-official-file 과 --single-retailer-file 은 함께 필요"}
{"offset": "0x5b060", "text": "_single_file_report.<locals>.genexpr"}
{"offset": "0x5b0a0", "text": "단건 모드: 공홈 LG.com PDP HTML 파일 경로 (--single-retailer-file 과 함께)"}
{"offset": "0x5b100", "text": "\n        SELECT DISTINCT t.mpc,\n               (p.url IS NOT NULL) AS has_url,\n               (e.ean IS NOT NULL) AS has_ean\n          FROM pdp_target_list t\n          LEFT JOIN pdp_20260622 p\n                 ON UPPER(p.sales_model_code) = UPPER(SUBSTRING_INDEX(t.mpc, '.', 1))\n                AND p.locale LIKE CONCAT(%s, '%%')\n          LEFT JOIN product_ean e\n                 ON e.model_mpc = UPPER(SUBSTRING_INDEX(t.mpc, '.', 1))\n         WHERE t.batch_id=%s AND t.rtlr_name=%s AND t.cntry_cd=%s\n               AND t.mpc IS NOT NULL AND t.mpc <> ''\n         ORDER BY has_url DESC, has_ean DESC\n    "}
{"offset": "0x5b360", "text": "[-_](d|m|mobile|desktop|tablet|thumbnail|thumb|zoom)(?=[-_.(]|$)"}
